<title>UK: Wuertthyp sets 100 mln mark five-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Wuertthyp sets 100 mln mark five-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up Pfandbrief was announced by lead manager Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Munich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTENBERGISCHE HYPOTHKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0 PCT   MATURITY  **21.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.80     PAY DATE    21.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    STUTT     DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE AND TWO, 6.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		**CALL AT PAR ON 21.JAN.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
